{"name":"Puppy Love","hex":"#e2babf","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"puppy love","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A childish or youthful infatuation with another person."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/puppy_love"}],"entries":[{"title":"Puppy love","blocks":[{"text":"Puppy love, also known as a crush, is an informal term for feelings of romantic love, often felt during childhood and early adolescence. It is an infatuation often developed by one's looks and attractiveness at first sight. It is named for its resemblance to the affection that may be felt by a puppy. It is commonly associated with feelings of emotional attachment."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puppy_love"},{"title":"Puppy Love (Paul Anka song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Puppy Love\" is a popular song written by Canadian-American singer Paul Anka in 1960 for Annette Funicello, a Mouseketeer, on whom he had a crush. Anka's version reached No. 2 on the Billboard Hot 100 behind Percy Faith's \"Theme from A Summer Place\", No. 4 on the Canadian CHUM Charts, and No. 33 on the UK Singles Chart."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/8b/Puppy_Love_-_Paul_Anka.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puppy_Love_(Paul_Anka_song)"},{"title":"Puppy","blocks":[{"text":"A puppy is a juvenile dog, generally one less than 12–18 months old."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Golde33443.jpg/330px-Golde33443.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puppy"},{"title":"Love","blocks":[{"text":"Love encompasses a range of strong and positive emotional and mental states, from the most sublime virtue or good habit, the deepest interpersonal affection, to the simplest pleasure. An example of this range of meanings is that the love of a mother differs from the love of a spouse, which differs from the love for food. Most commonly, love refers to a feeling of strong attraction and emotional attachment."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f3/Puppyloveosmond.jpg/250px-Puppyloveosmond.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/f/f3/Puppyloveosmond.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/f/f3/Puppyloveosmond.jpg/250px-Puppyloveosmond.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APuppyloveosmond.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/e5/Puppy_Love_Sleigh_Ride.jpg/250px-Puppy_Love_Sleigh_Ride.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e5/Puppy_Love_Sleigh_Ride.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/e/e5/Puppy_Love_Sleigh_Ride.jpg/250px-Puppy_Love_Sleigh_Ride.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APuppy_Love_Sleigh_Ride.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Cara_de_quem_caiu_do_caminh%C3%A3o..._%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Cara_de_quem_caiu_do_caminh%C3%A3o..._%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Cara_de_quem_caiu_do_caminh%C3%A3o..._%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Cara_de_quem_caiu_do_caminh%C3%A3o..._%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Basset Hound","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACara_de_quem_caiu_do_